+ * not to a wlroots render pass. The normal texture and rectangle paths restore
+ * their own state, but a failing vendor call can interrupt that cleanup. Do a
+ * best-effort restore before finishing an already-failed pass so a later
+ * recovery frame never inherits a stale clip or alpha value. This deliberately
+ * stays off the successful fast path.
